What is Expressioin ?
===========================================                    

Any statement which contains operator and operand.

Expression:
2+3
6-5*4/1
2+3.0


A lower type operand will be automatically upgraded to corressponding higher type operand before solving Expression

1.
int------long
+
long----->long
=
long

2.
float------>double
+
double----->double
=
